[l_braz_por.infrastructure]
Infraestrutura

[l_braz_por.infrastructure_desc]
Essa construção concede melhoria de infraestrutura ao estado. Ela aumenta seu poder de abastecimento em regiões estratégicas e aumenta a velocidade de suas divisões, além de aumentar sua extração de recursos.

[l_braz_por.infrastructure_plural]
Infraestruturas

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
Velocidade de edificação de infraestruturas

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de edificação de infraestruturas.

[l_english.infrastructure]
Infrastructure

[l_english.infrastructure_desc]
This building provides the state with improvement of infrastructure. It increases your supply power in strategic regions and increases your divisions' speed, as well as increasing your raw resource extraction.

[l_english.infrastructure_plural]
Infrastructure

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
§YInfrastructure§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Infrastructure construction.

[l_french.infrastructure]
Infrastructure

[l_french.infrastructure_desc]
Ce type de bâtiments améliore les infrastructures des États, en améliorant les capacités de ravitaillement des régions stratégiques, en permettant aux divisions de se déplacer plus rapidement et en accroissant l'extraction de matières premières.

[l_french.infrastructure_plural]
Infrastructures

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
Vitesse de constr. des infrastructures 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des infrastructures.

[l_german.infrastructure]
Infrastruktur

[l_german.infrastructure_desc]
Mit diesem Gebäude wird die staatliche Infrastruktur verbessert. Es erhöht Ihre Nachschubstärke in strategischen Regionen, die Geschwindigkeit Ihrer Divisionen sowie Ihre Rohstoffgewinnung.

[l_german.infrastructure_plural]
Infrastruktur

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit (Infrastruktur)

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für die Infrastruktur.

[l_japanese.infrastructure]
インフラ

[l_japanese.infrastructure_desc]
州のインフラの改善を行う。戦略地域の物資供給力を増加させ、師団の移動速度を上げ、さらに資源の産出量を増やす。

[l_japanese.infrastructure_plural]
インフラ

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
§Yインフラ§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
インフラ建設速度を補正する。

[l_korean.infrastructure]
기반시설

[l_korean.infrastructure_desc]
이 건물은 해당 주의 기반시설을 향상합니다. 또한 전략 지역의 보급력과 사단의 속도를 높일 뿐만 아니라, 원자재 획득량을 증가시킵니다.

[l_korean.infrastructure_plural]
기반시설

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
§Y기반시설§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
기반시설 건설 속도 변동치.

[l_polish.infrastructure]
Infrastruktura

[l_polish.infrastructure_desc]
Ten budynek zwiększa poziom infrastruktury regionu, co umożliwia sprawniejsze przerzucanie zaopatrzenia i przemieszczanie dywizji, a także zwiększa ilość wydobywanych surowców naturalnych.

[l_polish.infrastructure_plural]
Infrastruktura

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
Tempo budowy infrastruktury

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Zmiana tempa budowy infrastruktury.

[l_russian.infrastructure]
Инфраструктура

[l_russian.infrastructure_desc]
Это сооружение позволяет улучшать инфраструктуру региона, увеличивая объем поставок и скорость перемещения ваших дивизий.

[l_russian.infrastructure_plural]
Инфраструктура

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
Скорость строительства §Yинфраструктуры§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства инфраструктуры.

[l_simp_chinese.infrastructure]
基础设施

[l_simp_chinese.infrastructure_desc]
此建筑将改善所属地区的基础设施状况，提高你在战略要地的后勤能力及你的陆军部队在本地区的移动速度，并提升此地区的基础资源产出。

[l_simp_chinese.infrastructure_plural]
基础设施

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
§Y基础设施§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
改变基础设施建设的建设速度。

[l_spanish.infrastructure]
Infraestructura

[l_spanish.infrastructure_desc]
El Estado disfruta de una mejora en la infraestructura gracias a este edificio. Incrementa tu suministro de energía en regiones estratégicas y aumenta la velocidad de las divisiones y la extracción de materias primas.

[l_spanish.infrastructure_plural]
Infraestructuras

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de §YInfraestructura§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de construcción de infraestructuras.

